message: "If you use this repository, please cite the manuscript and this software record."
title: "Christus: a persistent artificial cognitive organism"
abstract: >-
  Christus is a persistent artificial cognitive architecture integrating a
  recurrent SM-CTRN core, embodied action, experience provenance,
  autobiographical memory, affective regulation and self-related representation.
  The mirror-guided hidden-marker experiment passed in 20/20 seeds.
